<description>&lt;p&gt;A fire in a Phuket shophouse killed 11 people and injured dozens, prompting an investigation into its cause. Thailand deployed two F-16 jets to Mae Hong Son and another pair to the Myanmar border in response to air activity by the Myanmar air force. Cambodia issued a declaration urging Thailand to resume border demarcation, while Thailand rejected Cambodian wording on displaced people at an ASEAN meeting. Hun Manet thanked France and President Macron for their role in seeking a peaceful resolution to the border dispute. The conflict recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNNnYyUWlSUkxpMlFaNUxBS3BmUzlReXN0eTJ3R1NyWExBT04zWDNUdlNZZmg0b21SV2RVeTNCQ3p3cmJieVVHckdHWUxTdzJxSEt1MHlvZHBYUi15a1pkNmkxZVpIQmFUcDkwUkZ2bkVRYkM0SlVmcXFpOTdaSXFOMkJXVzc4WGh5Rk5xdGJXRDZTSVhTZG10M2twb29sTHZmM042WFN0aV9hYlJLU0NDdjlCQ3RNbFlR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Phnom Penh Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNazBGWGJiWXZHc0V4ekptc1BLSzYxTmVDN3VyVFMtY0pXank1Zl9xY0FZd3FIelVoVTMyM2RoSG9hVEVZX0NHdTlFOThRN05QWXZMRkxBQXM1TkVMbGdHb2o0eVB6ZGYzSVp0WkRNZDk5NzZZSkgzaFV3WXRYMjNmaDA0WTN2alFvdnpkZ3VPRWpoakxZUTNYLXJEQUoyaHo4MU5OclNHNEtkYnF5?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQcjBZU29UMkNFMzdxYmZiRXNGSW5Qa1FuUmJzeGdLTjFacWptdFpWVkllVmZrWmJlM0xtMXl5OTdiaXIzRGEzT0N6NlZPVHI1bkktZnR3MmsweEVBX1F6S0NzMlpXTXpkRWlJeXVvbkxzQUlObVhUeHNpNk42WGFqc2hsMGRXWDNrbTVvT3dBNjIyZ3M?oc=5&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE43VVNvdGZYTmx0UFJ4THZwTkRxU0Q5ajBuM0U1ZEJuU0RLZ04wRVJldllkQXFfeUJ0VzVoejJJb2FvNG0zYlFuTGJRN2hYZ09kNFdwN3d3WktFaWQ4